[Desktop Entry]
Name=Abbreviations
Comment=Expand abbreviations and copy them to the clipboard
Icon=edit-paste
Type=Service
X-KDE-PluginInfo-Author=Nicolas Vaughan
X-KDE-PluginInfo-Name=krunner-abbr
X-KDE-PluginInfo-Version=__VERSION__
X-KDE-PluginInfo-License=GPL-3.0-or-later
X-KDE-PluginInfo-EnabledByDefault=true
X-Plasma-API=DBus2
X-Plasma-API-Minimum-Version=2.0
X-Plasma-DBusRunner-Service=io.github.nivaca.AbbrKRunner
X-Plasma-DBusRunner-Path=/runner
X-Plasma-Runner-Min-Letter-Count=2
X-Plasma-Runner-Syntaxes=ex :q:,ex :q:|paste,ex |upper :q:,ex case :q:,ex clip :q:,ex settings,ex help
X-Plasma-Runner-Syntax-Descriptions=Expands the abbreviation :q: and copies the result. The keyword alone lists all abbreviations.,Expands :q: and pastes the result in the window where you were.,Applies filters (like |upper or |join) to :q: or to the clipboard.,Shows :q: (or the clipboard) in every case style.,Searches the clipboard history for :q:.,Opens the settings dialog.,Opens the reference: placeholders and filters and quote styles.
